   <narrative xml:lang="EN">FHS, CATS assignments -08</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">FHS, CATS assignments -08</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">CATS fick I uppdrag av Sida att utveckla kunskap och samarbete inom omr&#xe5;dena f&#xf6;r utvecklingssamarbete och terrorist prevention. Uppdraget bestod av tv&#xe5; delar; att st&#xf6;dja forskning och &quot;lessons learned&quot; processer, samt att utf&#xf6;ra eventuella framtida uppdrag, alla med individuella direktiv.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sida entered into agreement with the Swedish National Defence College,Center for Asymetrical Studies (CATS) in order to develop knowledge and cooperation in the area of development cooperation and prevention of terrorism.The agreement covers two areas: Support to research and lessons learned process &amp; Agreement on possible future assignments(eg strategic analysis) with sepToR for each assignement.</narrative>
  </description>
